# Kiosk stack for the Syncphony box: cage (Wayland kiosk compositor),
# chromium, and color emoji for the room UI. The session itself is assembled
# in 01-kiosk.
cage
chromium
fonts-noto-color-emoji
# mDNS: the box advertises <hostname>.local (set from name= in syncphony.txt),
# which the setup screen's QR code points phones at.
avahi-daemon
# The kiosk wrapper probes boxd with curl; boxd checks the server's /healthz
# (including over HTTPS) before the kiosk navigates.
curl
ca-certificates
